# DuDuClaw OS — scheduled quick secaudit self-scan timer (WS-3, 2026-09-01,
# DESIGN-os-security-line-2026-09.md §2 secaudit 遷入 D2' / 拍板 D4:
# "預設開、每日 quick").
#
# RandomizedDelaySec spreads the actual fire time across a window instead
# of every appliance in a fleet waking up and hammering disk/CPU at
# exactly the same wall-clock instant (systemd.timer(5)'s own documented
# purpose for this directive — thundering-herd avoidance, not a security
# property). Persistent=true catches up a missed daily run if the machine
# was off at the scheduled time (appliances are not assumed to be
# powered on 24/7) rather than silently skipping a whole day's scan.
[Unit]
Description=DuDuClaw OS scheduled quick secaudit self-scan (daily)

[Timer]
OnCalendar=daily
RandomizedDelaySec=1h
Persistent=true

[Install]
WantedBy=timers.target
